## SQ-MELT-03 | lava source, flowing lava, lava cauldron melt ice at 4; source at 5 not
@group A
@commands Ice at distance 4 and at distance 5 from a lava source; ice at 4 from flowing lava (`setblock ... minecraft:lava[level=3]`, blocked from spreading by a glass ring); a `lava_cauldron` with ice at 4; wait 90 s
